        "color": 4,
        "width": 584,
        "height": 488,
        "content": "## 🎨 AI Visual Generator (Claude + Gemini)\n\nDescribe an image in plain words. Claude engineers a rich prompt, Google Gemini generates the image, and it lands in your inbox — every prompt logged for reuse.\n\n**Flow:** Form → Normalize → Claude (prompt enhance) → Gemini (image) → email + log.\n\n### Setup\n1. Connect **Anthropic**, **Google Gemini (PaLM)**, and **Gmail** credentials.\n2. Activate and share the form URL.\n3. Describe an image, pick a style, submit."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
